NOTICE ON RELIGIOUS TEXTS, TRANSLATIONS, AND AUDIO RECITATIONS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT License above applies to the SalahMate application source code, UI
layouts, and custom vector assets.

Religious texts, translations, and audio recitations accessed or bundled within
the application—including the Tanzil Uthmani Quranic Arabic text, Muhiuddin Khan
Bengali translation, Saheeh International English translation, Mishary Rashid
Alafasy audio recitation (via AlQuran.cloud), and canonical Hadith/Dua texts—are
governed by their respective terms and attribution requirements documented in
CONTENT_LICENSES.md. Forks and redistributions must preserve the verbatim
integrity of the Arabic Quranic text and maintain clear translator and source
attribution.
